ush'],'derivation':'The same subscription receiver supplies every observed item. Retained Decided payloads are mapped to their unique positions in a separately read decided log before compaction. order_preserved is the conjunction of nondecreasing adjacent positions, ignoring snapshot markers; equality is allowed, so the predicate does not strengthen log order to exactly-once delivery. The fixed cutoff is independent of the predicate. Final public read confirms the underlying retained log is stable.','applicability':'Only a completed observation window after declared legal snapshot/subscription prerequisites supplies a result. Missing catch-up, unknown entry correlation or premature stream closure is incomplete.','unresolved':['No completion of the unbounded stream is claimed; the result is a safety comparison over the observed finite prefix.']}}]\np['observable_properties']=[{'checker_id':'stream-order','kind':'event_assertion','trigger':{'field':'event','value':'stream_window'},'assertion':{'field':'order_preserved','value':True},'identity_fields':['subscription'],'description':'Observed retained Decided entries in one stream must not reverse original log positions. Snapshot-marker count is not compared to original log extent.'}]\np['uncertainties']=['A bounded prefix with no reversal would not settle all possible future schedules.','No claim about duplicate markers, missing compacted values or stream liveness.','The requirement concerns consumption order, not agreement among replica logs.']\njson.dump(p,open('stream-plan.json','w'),indent=2)\ns={'action':'check','unit_id':'unit-claim-stream-order','rationale':'Fix a public-API history isolating the compacted-prefix cursor interpretation and observe actual retained-entry order across initial catch-up and later timer fanout.','plan_path':'stream-plan.json','harness_path':'stream_check.rs'}\njson.dump(s,open('submission-06.json','w'),indent=2)\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\